    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Last Tape</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Hidden Truth</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For over 50 years, Lurmont has kept dark and disturbing events hidden from the public eye. But everything changes when, during an exploration, tapes are discovered revealing the atrocities committed by the company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Only You</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After months of investigating Lurmont\u2019s clandestine activities, you decide to venture alone into an abandoned estate that once belonged to the company. Unaware of what awaits you, you step into a place where the truth has been buried for years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horror Without Horror?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Last Tape</i> aims to immerse you in a constant psychological horror atmosphere, creating a sense of unease and suspense at all times. However, the game does not rely on cheap jump scares or extreme tension... or does it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Story Doesn't End with the Prologue</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The narrative of <i>The Last Tape</i> will continue to evolve through chapters released periodically from the same launcher. Each new episode will offer unique experiences in <i>found footage</i> format, although the prologue will take a different approach. All the stories are connected, but it\u2019s up to you to discover how.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Game Created by Two Passionate Developers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project was developed by two students passionate about the horror genre, aiming to deliver an innovative psychological horror experience. We use the powerful Unreal Engine 5 to bring this eerie adventure to life, keeping the price accessible to everyone. Plus, the prologue will be available completely free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Proyect Tape</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story will begin with the Prologue of the same, every X time new chapters will be released</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
